Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.39,stats,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs9\c&HFCFDFF&\fad(90,0)\t(90,257,\c&HFCFFDF&)\4c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\4c&HB9C45F&)\3c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\3c&HB9C45F&)\bord1.5\shad\pos(489.286,61.714)}Roślinoludzie
